    <item>
      <title>Policy Discovery</title>
      <link>https://engine.speedle.io/docs/pms/discover/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://engine.speedle.io/docs/pms/discover/</guid>
      
      <description>Speedle can be used for authorization decisions in systems with a large number of protected resources. Before those protected resources can be accessed, the Speedle authorization decision API (is-allowed API) is called. Defining the authorization policies for those protected resources is difficult if you don&#39;t know what actions are occuring on the protected resources, or how a protected resource is expressed in an authorization decision request. Policy discovery mode can make this task much easier</description>
    </item>
    
